caption: Mastery Unlocks
tradition-component: mastery-unlocks

After Mastery, Universal Shadow Arts Conditioning permits Regeneration to be improved from Fast to Very Fast (1 FP/second; Fatigue Only, -0%) [100] by paying the normal point difference. This remains FP-only Regeneration and does not restore HP.
